# Catalog. Log in first (requests/auth.http) for the company endpoints.
# Prices are integers in minor units of the company currency:
# 4850000 = 48,500.00 ETB. Dimensions are millimetres, weight grams.

@base = http://localhost:5050
@companyId = paste-company-id-here
@productId = paste-product-id-here

### ---- public (no login) ----

### Categories
GET {{base}}/v1/catalog/categories

### Browse: newest first, 20 per page. Pass next_cursor back as ?cursor=
GET {{base}}/v1/catalog/products?category=sofas&sort=newest&limit=20

### Price filters need a currency
GET {{base}}/v1/catalog/products?currency=ETB&min_price=1000000&max_price=5000000&sort=price_asc

### One product by company slug + product slug
GET {{base}}/v1/catalog/products/demo-furniture/oslo-3-seat-sofa

### ---- company (any active member) ----

### Create a draft (slug derived from name when omitted)
POST {{base}}/v1/companies/{{companyId}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "sofas",
  "name": "Oslo 3-Seat Sofa",
  "description": "Linen upholstery, solid oak legs",
  "price_minor": 4850000,
  "width_mm": 2100,
  "depth_mm": 900,
  "height_mm": 820,
  "weight_g": 42000
}

### List own products, any status
GET {{base}}/v1/companies/{{companyId}}/products?status=draft&limit=20

### Edit (send only what changes; "weight_g": null clears it)
PATCH {{base}}/v1/companies/{{companyId}}/products/{{productId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "price_minor": 4600000 }

### Lifecycle: draft -> published -> archived -> draft
POST {{base}}/v1/companies/{{companyId}}/products/{{productId}}/publish
###
POST {{base}}/v1/companies/{{companyId}}/products/{{productId}}/archive
###
POST {{base}}/v1/companies/{{companyId}}/products/{{productId}}/restore

### Delete (drafts only)
DELETE {{base}}/v1/companies/{{companyId}}/products/{{productId}}
